# Direct dependencies of the nbno skill's scripts. requirements.txt is the
# lock compiled from this file with Python 3.10 (the oldest Python the skill
# meets: the Cowork local VM, 2026-10), and Dependabot keeps it current.
# Every install uses the lock as constraints: pip install -c requirements.txt …
# Regenerate: pip-compile --strip-extras --no-emit-index-url requirements.in
